---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
// Dedicated About page: the founding narrative + mission, goals, how EBNEO works, and the
// society's non-profit details. Sources: markdown_output/home.md and author-instructions.md.
const total = (await getCollection('commentaries')).filter((c) => c.data.status !== 'draft').length;
---
<Base title="About"
      description="About the International Society for Evidence-Based Neonatology (EBNEO): our mission, goals, and how we turn the best neonatal research into practice.">
  <section class="panel">
    <div class="hero">
      <svg class="pulse" viewBox="0 0 240 60" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M0 40 H60 L72 40 L84 14 L100 52 L112 26 L124 26 L132 8 L144 40 H240"
          stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="badge">International Society · Founded 2015</span>
      <h1>About EBNEO</h1>
      <p class="lede">The International Society for Evidence-Based Neonatology shares one vision: that
        all neonatal care should be firmly built on the best available evidence, with the shortest
        possible path from research to the newborn's bedside.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section"><Icon name="info" />Our mission</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Why EBNEO exists.</p>
    <div class="box" style="margin-bottom:8px">
      <p>EBNEO was founded in 2015 with a vision that neonatal care should be firmly based on the best
        available evidence. That vision centres on a short passage from research-based knowledge to
        implementation at the bedside, a process known as translation, thereby improving survival,
        decreasing morbidity, and promoting long-lasting health for newborn infants.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0">The society brings together neonatologists and researchers across
        more than ten countries to appraise the literature, discuss what it means for practice, and
        make that knowledge easy for clinicians everywhere to find and act on.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section"><Icon name="award2" />Our goals</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">What the society works toward, every month.</p>
    <div class="grid goals">
      <div class="goal"><Icon name="globe" /><p>Provide an international forum to communicate and support evidence-based medicine for neonatal care in a global context.</p></div>
      <div class="goal"><Icon name="search" /><p>Provide an interactive forum for the critical evaluation of the literature.</p></div>
      <div class="goal"><Icon name="activity" /><p>Give neonatal care-givers the best available knowledge by widening the dissemination of evidence-based neonatology.</p></div>
      <div class="goal"><Icon name="check" /><p>Facilitate research on diagnostic procedures and interventions for important clinical outcomes.</p></div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section"><Icon name="file" />How EBNEO works</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">From a new study to a bedside-ready summary.</p>
    <div class="split">
      <div class="box">
        <h3>Monthly evidence commentaries</h3>
        <p>In collaboration with and supported by <a href="https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/journal/16512227" rel="noopener">Acta Paediatrica</a>,
          EBNEO publishes monthly, concise, user-friendly, peer-reviewed summaries of the best
          original articles on the clinical care of neonates.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:0">Each summary pairs a structured abstract of the primary literature
          with a brief commentary on the study's clinical implications. The commentary appears in Acta
          Paediatrica, and the structured abstract is published here, where {total}+ now form a
          searchable archive.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="box">
        <h3>Where to go next</h3>
        <p>Read the archive, take part in the monthly vote, or contribute a commentary of your own.</p>
        <p style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:0">
          <a class="btn" href="/reviews/"><Icon name="file" />Browse reviews</a>
          <a class="btn" href="/vote/"><Icon name="award" />Cast your vote</a>
          <a class="btn" href="/authors/"><Icon name="edit" />Write for EBNEO</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section"><Icon name="users" />The society</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Governance and registration.</p>
    <div class="box">
      <p>EBNEO is a registered non-profit organisation in Sweden. Its organisation and fiscal number
        is <strong>802493-2538</strong>. The society is led by an international Executive Board and was
        established by its founding chairs in 2015.</p>
      <p style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:0">
        <a class="btn" href="/#board"><Icon name="users" />Meet the board</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/contact/"><Icon name="mail" />Contact EBNEO</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
